<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-font name="Manrope" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" />
    <mj-preview>Capture, approve, and pay suppliers locally or overseas from one dashboard</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0" background-color="#FFFFFF" />
      <mj-column padding="0" />
      <mj-text font-family="Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" padding="0" />
      <mj-image padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      p { margin: 0 !important; }
      @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
        /* Add gap below image when image+text block stacks on mobile */
        .img-col { padding-bottom: 20px !important; }
        /* Stack stat/column cards vertically on mobile */
        table.col-wrap tr { display: block !important; }
        td.col-card { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; margin-bottom: 8px !important; }
        td.col-spacer { display: none !important; width: 0 !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#F0F2F5" width="600px">
    
  <mj-section background-color="#002771" padding="48px 32px 0">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-raw><table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:20px;padding:8px 20px;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#002771;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;">🧾 New Product · BillPay</td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" color="#FFFFFF" line-height="1.2" padding="0 0 16px">Make paying suppliers<br/>as easy as getting paid.</mj-text>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="15px" color="#D4D9E0" line-height="1.5" padding="0 8px 24px">Capture, approve, and pay suppliers — locally and overseas — right from the HitPay dashboard you already use to get paid.</mj-text>
      <mj-image src="img/billpay-hero.png" alt="Make paying suppliers
as easy as getting paid." border-radius="8px 8px 0 0" padding="0" />
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="32px 0 0" background-color="#FFFFFF"><mj-column /></mj-section>
    
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Hi {firstName},</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Right now, paying suppliers probably means chasing invoices across email and spreadsheets, logging into your bank one payment at a time, and reconciling it all by hand afterwards.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">BillPay brings that entire process into HitPay — the same platform you already use to get paid. Forward or upload an invoice, approve it, pay it, and watch it sync straight to Xero. No new software, no extra logins.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="36px" font-weight="700" color="#2465DE" line-height="1.2" padding="0 0 4px">100+</mj-text>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="14px" color="#61667C" padding="0 0 16px">Currencies</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="36px" font-weight="700" color="#2465DE" line-height="1.2" padding="0 0 4px">40+</mj-text>
      <mj-text align="center" font-size="14px" color="#61667C" padding="0 0 16px">Countries</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 24px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-divider border-color="#D4D9E0" border-width="1px" padding="8px 0 0" />
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" color="#002771" line-height="1.3" padding="0">Forward. Approve. Paid.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 24px">
    <mj-column padding="0">
      <mj-raw><table class="col-wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">✉️</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Forward</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Email an invoice to your BillPay inbox or upload it from your dashboard — no template needed.</p>
        </td><td width="8" class="col-spacer" style="width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0;"> </td><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">✅</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Approve</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">OCR pulls out the details, and your approval workflow routes it to the right person.</p>
        </td><td width="8" class="col-spacer" style="width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0;"> </td><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">💸</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Paid</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Fund it via PayNow or bank transfer, on the date you choose.</p>
        </td></tr></tbody></table></mj-raw>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 24px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-divider border-color="#D4D9E0" border-width="1px" padding="8px 0 0" />
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" color="#002771" line-height="1.3" padding="0">Turn every invoice into a ready-to-approve bill</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Forward an invoice to your BillPay inbox, or upload it straight from your dashboard. OCR and AI read the vendor, amount, account number, and due date automatically.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-raw>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
