      <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" color="#002771" line-height="1.3" padding="0">Pay a local supplier and an overseas supplier — in the same batch</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Most businesses use their bank for local transfers and a separate service for anything international. BillPay handles both in one workflow, so a PayNow transfer and an overseas wire can sit in the same approval run — in 100+ currencies, to 40+ countries.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-raw>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
